{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28111","headline":"赠玉芝观王尊师 · 雍陶","name":"赠玉芝观王尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"处处烟霞寻总遍，却来城市喜逢师。\n时流见说无人在，年纪唯应有鹤知。\n大药已成宁畏晚，小松初种不嫌迟。\n长忧一日归天去，未授灵方遣问谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}